==Bulgarian==

===Etymology===
Deadjectival adverb from {{der|bg|sla-pro|*skorъ||rapid}}. Equivalent to {{affix|bg|скор|t1=rapid, speedy|-о}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{bg-IPA|ско́ро}}
* {{audio|bg|LL-Q7918 (bul)-Kiril kovachev-скоро.wav}}

===Adverb===
{{bg-adv|ско́ро|comp=+}}

# [[recently]] (in the past)
#: {{syn|bg|неда́вна<qq:archaic>}}
# [[soon]] (in the future)
# [[rapidly]], [[swiftly]]
#: {{syn|bg|бъ́рзо}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|bg|скорошен||recent}}
* {{l|bg|отскоро||since recently}}
* {{l|bg|наскоро||at recent time}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|bg|скорост||speed}}
